# Automatic Door Controller

## Description
An Automatic Door Controller automatically opens and closes a door when a person is detected by a sensor.

## Features
- Automatic door opening
- Automatic door closing
- Sensor-based control
- Verilog HDL implementation
- Testbench and simulation included

## Files
- `automatic_door_controller.v` – Main Verilog code
- `automatic_door_controller_tb.v` – Testbench
- `simulation/` – Simulation results

## Tools Used
- Verilog HDL
- EDA Playground / ModelSim / Vivado

